nail, current tab, current page, checked filter, focused field, hover • Announcement bar, header, footer, hero, stats, brand strip, product card, style tiles, review card, newsletter, filter panel, price range, chips, pagination, gallery, pickers, stepper, tabs, review list, cart line item, order summary • How photos are cropped and placed\" 596x200 :: • Layout, grid, grouping, order and emphasis on every page | • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces (hero, cards, newsletter), discount, rating, verified mark, error / disabled | • Type scale (letter case, which levels use Archivo Black), spacing, radii, elevation | • All states: current nav item, selected color / size / thumbnail, current tab, current page, checked filter, focused field, hover | • Announcement bar, header, footer, hero, stats, brand strip, product card, style tiles, review card, newsletter, filter panel, price range, chips, pagination, gallery, pickers, stepper, tabs, review list, cart line item, order summary | • How photos are cropped and placed\n  FRAME 5:88 \"How it is evaluated\" 1312x281\n    TEXT 5:89 \"How it is evaluated\" 222x35 :: How it is evaluated\n    TEXT 5:90 \"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\" 1312x22 :: Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\n    TEXT 5:91 \"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current nav, selected options, current tab and page)\" 1312x154 :: 1. Checklist coverage per frame | 2. Data & copy accuracy | 3. Flow & prototype completeness | 4. Information hierarchy | 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system | 6. Component reuse | 7. State design (current nav, selected options, current tab and page)\n    TEXT 5:92 \"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" 1312x22 :: Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 4 named frames, your components and the prototype.\n=== 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\nFRAME 1:5 \"Foundations\" 1400x853 fill#ffffff\n  TEXT 1:6 \"Foundations · SHOP.CO\" 367x39 :: Foundations · SHOP.CO\n  TEXT 1:7 \"Fixed: the brand color and the two typefaces below. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, backgrounds and surfaces (including the hero and card backgrounds), discount color, rating color, verified mark, link and selected states, error / disabled, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid.\" 1288x57 :: Fixed: the brand color and the two typefaces below. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, backgrounds and surfaces (including the hero and card backgrounds), discount color, rating color, verified mark, link and selected states, error / disabled, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid.\n  TEXT 1:8 \"Brand color\" 112x24 :: Brand color\n  FRAME 1:9 \"Brand primary · black\" 220x222\n    RECTANGLE 1:10 \"Rectangle\" 220x120 fill#000000\n    TEXT 1:11 \"Brand primary · black\" 144x17 :: Brand primary · black\n    TEXT 1:12 \"#000000\" 57x16 :: #000000\n    TEXT 1:13 \"The store’s main ink and action color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\" 220x45 :: The store’s main ink and action color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\n  TEXT 1:14 \"Typefaces\" 101x24 :: Typefaces\n  TEXT 1:15 \"ARCHIVO BLACK — NEW ARRIVALS\" 778x44 :: ARCHIVO BLACK — NEW ARRIVALS\n  TEXT 1:16 \"Plus Jakarta Sans — Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 $260\" 720x40 :: Plus Jakarta Sans — Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  $260\n  TEXT 1:17 \"Use Archivo Black for the SHOP.CO wordmark and display headings, Plus Jakarta Sans for all other UI text. Which levels use which typeface, sizes, weights, letter case and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\" 1288x34 :: Use Archivo Black for the SHOP.CO wordmark and display headings, Plus Jakarta Sans for all other UI text. Which levels use which typeface, sizes, weights, letter case and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\n  TEXT 1:18 \"Canvas: desktop web, 1440 wide. Light mode. Frame heights are free — every page scrolls vertically.\" 1288x17 :: Canvas: desktop web, 1440 wide. Light mode. Frame heights are free — every page scrolls vertically."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33fdca80-10af-4719-bef6-cca51e068667","uuid":"d26ea78e-af3c-4743-b509-71f0ca086fef","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:17:37.845Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 5:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 1440x4777 fill#ffffff\n  FRAME 5:3 \"Header\" 1312x145\n    TEXT 5:4 \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" 182x19 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT 5:5 \"SHOP.CO — fashion store website\" 1312x52 :: SHOP.CO — fashion store website\n    TEXT 5:6 \"Design a fashion e-commerce website: discover new arrivals and best sellers, filter a category, review a product and its customer reviews, and check the cart. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" 1312x50 :: Design a fashion e-commerce website: discover new arrivals and best sellers, filter a category, review a product and its customer reviews, and check the cart. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME 5:7 \"How to work\" 1312x249\n    TEXT 5:8 \"How to work\" 147x35 :: How to work\n    TEXT 5:9 \"1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the two typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the photos, the social and payment logos and the icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" 1312x198 :: 1. Build exactly the 4 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. | 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. | 3. The brand color and the two typefaces in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. | 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button and a default Text Field. Design all other states, the header, the footer, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. | 5. Use the photos, the social and payment logos and the icons from 04 · Media. | 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\n  FRAME 5:10 \"Frames · goals · must include · links\" 1312x1525\n    TEXT 5:11 \"Frames · goals · must include · links\" 413x35 :: Frames · goals · must include · links\n    TEXT 5:12 \"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" 1312x22 :: Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\n    FRAME 5:13 \"Frame cards\" 1312x1436\n      FRAME 5:14 \"01_Home\" 644x716 fill#f7f7fa\n        TEXT 5:15 \"01_Home\" 82x26 :: 01_Home\n        TEXT 5:16 \"Goal: Get inspired and find something to buy.\" 596x20 :: Goal: Get inspired and find something to buy.\n        TEXT 5:17 \"MUST INCLUDE\" 84x16 :: MUST INCLUDE\n        TEXT 5:18 \"• Announcement bar: “Sign up and get 20% off to your first order.” · “Sign Up Now” · close (Icon_Close) • Brands: NORDE · ATELIER K · MONVALE · RIVA · CASSEL (as wordmarks) • Browse by dress style: “BROWSE BY DRESS STYLE” · Casual · Formal · Party · Gym, each with its photo (Photo_Style_Casual, Photo_Style_Formal, Photo_Style_Party, Photo_Style_Gym) • Customer reviews: “OUR HAPPY CUSTOMERS” · previous / next (Icon_Arrow_Left, Icon_Arrow_Right) · 3 review cards with 5-star rating, name, verified mark (Icon_Verified) and quote (see DATA) • Footer: see DATA (Footer) • Header: “SHOP.CO” wordmark · navigation Shop (Icon_Chevron_Down) / On Sale / New Arrivals / Brands · no item current · search field “Search for products...” (Icon_Search) · cart (Icon_Cart) · account (Icon_Account) • Hero: “FIND CLOTHES THAT MATCH YOUR STYLE” · copy (see DATA) · “Shop Now” · stats 200+ International Brands · 2,000+ High-Quality Products · 30,000+ Happy Customers · Photo_Hero · two Icon_Sparkle • New Arrivals: “NEW ARRIVALS” · 4 product cards, each with photo, name, rating (Icon_Star, Icon_Star_Half) with score, price, and old price + discount where given (see DATA) · “View All” • Newsletter: “STAY UP TO DATE ABOUT OUR LATEST OFFERS” · email field “Enter your email address” · “Subscribe to Newsletter” • Top Selling: “TOP SELLING” · 4 product cards, each with photo, name, rating (Icon_Star, Icon_Star_Half) with score, price, and old price + discount where given (