{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_crvsjxye4snvnq7e57rbsxqgrwskkhtxljdtfie5642coiz26xyq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've built all four screens in 03 · Workspace and wired the clickable prototype. I took a screenshot of every screen and fixed the visible problems I found.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/1lB6sFZZe3WOcgYZxebEca/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `6:2` (account confirmed as zuohaosheng@tetras.ai)\n\n**Screens:**\n| Frame | ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Home | `16:226` |\n| 02_Category | `17:630` |\n| 03_Product | `18:1020` |\n| 04_Cart | `19:1438` |\n\n**Screen content**\n- Every item in each frame's must-include list is on that frame, and copy and data are taken word for word from the brief.\n- The announcement bar, header, newsletter and footer appear on all four frames.\n- Header current item: Shop on 02 and 03, nothing on 01 and 04.\n- Selected states are designed: blue swatch and Large size on 02; olive, Large and the first thumbnail on 03; page 1 in pagination; the Rating & Reviews tab.\n\n**Design system and components** (two boards below the screens)\n- **Foundations board (`9:34`):** 17 text styles (Archivo Black for the wordmark and display headings, Plus Jakarta Sans for everything else), 13 color styles (brand #000000 plus my own neutrals, discount, rating and verified colors), 2 shadow styles, and the grid, spacing and corner-radius rules.\n- **Components board (`10:2`):** about 25 reusable components and variant sets. They cover every component and state the brief assigns to you, including the hover, focus and disabled states.\n- The supplied Button (`1:23`) and Text Field (`1:26`) are reused inside my button and input components. All photos, icons and logos are instances from 04 · Media.\n\n**Prototype** (flow start: 01_Home)\n- **01:** Shop Now, both View All buttons and the Casual tile → 02. The 8 product cards → 03. Header cart → 04.\n- **02:** the 9 product cards → 03. Breadcrumb Home → 01. Header cart → 04.\n- **03:** Add to Cart → 04. Breadcrumb Shop → 02. Header cart → 04.\n- **04:** the 3 cart items → 03. Breadcrumb Home → 01.\n- **Extra links:** the SHOP.CO wordmark → 01 on 02–04, and breadcrumb Home → 01 on 03.\n- Go to Checkout and everything else the brief marks \"entry only\" has no link.\n\n**Limitations**\n- **Links to the current page:** Figma won't let a frame navigate to itself. So on 03 the \"You might also like\" cards scroll back to the top of 03 instead of reopening it, and the header cart on 04 does the same.\n- **Hover, focus and disabled states:** these exist as component variants but aren't animated as hover interactions in the prototype.\n- **Reference pages:** 00, 01, 02 and 04 were only read, not changed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":132385,"cache_read_input_tokens":7701,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":132385,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"33fdca80-10af-4719-bef6-cca51e068667","uuid":"a9820a6d-5917-491f-9bd4-1f18d9e04c8a","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:36:19.324Z"}
